WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.175
Section 1: File a Private Prosecution under Criminal Code section 504.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:11.300
Any Canadian citizen can lay a criminal charge before a Justice of the Peace.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.562
This is a constitutional right, not a fringe legal theory.

00:00:15.562 --> 00:00:24.312
You need reasonable grounds that an indictable offence was committed, the evidence compiled on this site, and access to your nearest provincial court.
